{Black can play either ...Nxe4 or ...exd4 here, but must follow the opening rules.} exd4 (3... Nxe4 4. Bd3 d5 $11) 4. e5 Ng4 $6 {That is away from the centre.} (4... Ne4 5. Qxd4 d5 $1 6. exd6 Nxd6 $14) 5. Qxd4 Nh6
$4 (5... d6 {Would still offer a chance to survive.}) 6. Bxh6 gxh6 7. Nc3 {Black has now violated the opening rules and stands very badly.} Nc6 8. Qe4 d6
$2 {Too late.} 9. exd6+ Be6 10. Bb5 cxd6 11. Nd4 Be7 12. Nxc6 bxc6 13. Bxc6+ Kf8
14. Bxa8 d5 15. Bxd5 Bxd5 16. Nxd5 Qa5+ 17. b4 Bxb4+ 18. Qxb4+ Qxb4+ 19. Nxb4
